// service that deploys against a pending domain comes up without that domain's
// route, silently — reachable only at its automatic address, if it has one —
// and has to be deployed again afterwards.
//
// If it ends up `failed`, fix the DNS record and call retry_domain — do not add
// the domain a second time; it is already registered.
//
// The infrastructure must be READY and must have its gateway installed, because
// the load-balancer IP is what the certificate challenge is answered on.
//
// It needs the domain:create permission, changes state and is offered to agents
// and service accounts (surfaces: console, cli, agent).
