// stopped, with status_message naming what is still standing (call this again
// to resume — it is not a provision retry and Retry does not apply);
// AWAITING_CLEANUP when every cloud resource is gone but identities remain (GCP
// service accounts, AWS IAM roles), because deleting identities is a permission
// the platform is deliberately not granted. The infrastructure then stays in
// the list carrying the gcloud or AWS CLI script to run, until the customer
// confirms it is done.
