// group now) and `own_notify` (what its file wrote: a group, `none`, or empty
// for the application's). The service's application's own group is `notify` /
// `notify_exists` at the top: the default group of its alerts, and nothing else
// (a release's outcome reaches people only through its pipeline's notify
// steps). An alert applied before alert groups notifies no one until its
// application's next release. What an alert of the service may read is said
