// agent has none), `runtime`, `metrics` (the catalogue metrics it can alert on,
// each with its `title` and `unit`, `requests` for one counted from the
// requests the service is sent), `requests_not_collected` (why the
// infrastructure collects no request metrics, where it does not), `max_alerts`,
// and `source` — `repository`, where a change is a config PR of its
