// for the hosting's automatic HTTPS address (grafana.<infra>.<hosting domain>,
// available once the infrastructure's certificate is served), or
// {"mode":"domain","domain":"grafana.example.com"} for one of the
// infrastructure's ACTIVE domains that no service routes on; an install with
// neither is refused. `auth` is optional: {"mode":"login"} (the default,
// Grafana's own login as admin — the password is shown with
// reveal_addon_password) or
