// one is is refused 409 `investigation_running`, with that one as
// `investigation` — open it instead. Also refused: while the infrastructure's
// Agents app is not installed or has no model connection (409
// `agents_not_ready`, with `link` to set it up); while the infrastructure
// sleeps (409 `infrastructure_asleep`); once the month's investigation budget
// is spent (409 `budget_reached`); a cluster alert no longer firing (409
// `subject_gone`); an event that is neither a failure nor a warning (400
// `not_an_issue`); ten already waiting (429 `queue_full`). An agent cannot
// start one: a person does, from the issue's button. An investigation spends on
// the infrastructure's model connection, up to its budget ($1 by default) —
// get_investigation_status says the budget, the month's and what is spent.
